[0.244, "o", "\r\n:: The firewallD components & utilities have now been split into different packages:\r\n\r\n   - firewalld: Firewall daemon with D-Bus interface \r\n   - python-firewall: Python bindings for firewallD\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "   - firewall-config: Graphical user interface for firewallD\r\n   - firewall-applet: Systray applet for firewallD\r\n   - firewalld-test: FirewallD test suite\r\n\r\n   Make sure to install the ones you may want / need.\r\n\r\nOptional dependencies for firewalld\r\n\u001b[0;1m   \u001b[0m bash-completion: bash completion\r\n    networkmanager: NetworkManager support\r\n    polkit: privileged actions\r\n    firewall-config: Graphical user interface for firewallD configuration\r\n    firewall-applet: Systray applet for firewallD\r\n    firewalld-test: firewallD test suite\r\n(179/179) installing linux-firmware-radeon                                                             [------------------------------------------------------------]   0%\r"]
[0.020, "o", "(179/179) installing linux-firmware-radeon                                                             [############################################################] 100%\r\r\n"]
